Z||000000||starfighter007@msn.com||09-14-2001||08:31 PM||||Well I am sitting here alone while my wife is in Hawaii. I could not go for obvious reasons,no big deal really. But now I am really getting angry !What The f**k are we waiting for to do something I'm efin ready to go there now with my bare hands and kick some butt. <P>I wonder how long we would wait if this was Russia that crashed  planes into new york and washington.If we dont do something soon these people are going to be laughing even harder then they all ready are.||||reg||9
