Z||000002||Urchin||09-14-2001||09:16 PM||||Though Black88GT was a little harsh in his post (IMO), he is right.  I'm sure you are simply venting your frustrations here, but unfortunately this is going to take time. I'm sure once they have established without a doubt who the responsible parties are, there will not be much time wasted.  As I understand, they are in the process of forming a plan of attack as we speak.  I do agree though, I wish the process could be sped up a tad.  I guess all we can do is wait.  <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/final.jpg"> <BR>If you can read this, I'm parked.||||reg||1
