Z||000004||Raydar||09-14-2001||11:56 PM||||All in good time.<P>When we went into Desert Storm, we didn't attack right away. We took the time necessary to have our ducks in a row. Then, when we hit, we hit hard. Thing was over in a matter of weeks. <BR>Although I wish we would have marched on Baghdad. <BR>Maybe this time. <BR>We *will* be in the neighborhood.<BR>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>Black 88 Formula.<BR>Red 88 Duke coupe. "The Project" <BR>88 Formula parts car. "The Donor"<BR></FONT><BR><p>[This message has been edited by Raydar (edited 09-14-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000005||Cheever3000||09-15-2001||12:02 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>When we went into Desert Storm, we didn't attack right away. We took the time necessary to have our ducks in a row.<HR></BLOCKQUOTE>We didn't take time because we needed to... In the War Powers they granted to the President, Congress made the condition that he give Hussein every possible alternative and opportunity.  Bush was extremely generous.  <I>This</I> act of terror does not deserve such grace.<P>||||reg||1
